      "content": "wait, are you sure? i'm a little confused because my doctor was really firm about me avoiding stuff that raises blood pressure since i'm at stage 2. won't the sudafed make my heart race or something? i'm just worried that if i take it, my blood pressure will spike even higher while i'm sleeping and that could be bad. if i do take it, how much is actually safe? should i just take one and see?",
